{
  "_help": [
    "RCTV row layout: which rows show vertical posters and which show horizontal cards.",
    "Every row is horizontal unless this file says \"vertical\". Values: \"vertical\" or \"horizontal\".",
    "Name a row by the title you see on the TV (for example \"Disney Classics\") or by its id. Capitals don't matter.",
    "\"pages\" changes rows on one page only. \"rows\" changes a row with that name on every page.",
    "A page can also get a \"default\" (for example \"library\": {\"default\": \"vertical\"}) for all its rows or its grid.",
    "When a row is vertical, its See All page is vertical too.",
    "Save the change here (or from the website) and the TVs pick it up the next time the app is opened. No new build needed."
  ],
  "_example": {
    "pages": {
      "home": {
        "rows": {
